-<a name="nc_def_compound"></a>
-<a name="nc_005fdef_005fcompound"></a>
-<p><hr>
-Next:&nbsp;<a rel="next" accesskey="n" href="#nc_005finsert_005fcompound">nc_insert_compound</a>,
