-     <dl>
-<dt><code>NC_NOERR</code><dd>No error.
-
-     <br><dt><code>NC_EBADTYPEID</code><dd>Bad typeid.
-
-     <br><dt><code>NC_EBADFIELDID</code><dd>Bad fieldid.
-
-     <br><dt><code>NC_EHDFERR</code><dd>An error was reported by the HDF5 layer.
