-     
-     C     Read 1 record of NLONS*NLATS*NLVLS values, starting at the
-     C     beginning of the record (the (1, 1, 1, rec) element in the netCDF
-     C     file).
-           count(1) = NLONS
-           count(2) = NLATS
-           count(3) = NLVLS
-           count(4) = 1
-           start(1) = 1
-           start(2) = 1
-           start(3) = 1
