-<p><br></td></tr><tr align="left"><td valign="top" width="50%"><a href="netcdf-f90.html#NF90_005fPUT_005fVARA_005f-type">NF90_PUT_VARA_ type</a>
-</td><td valign="top" width="50%">write arrays of data
